        "original_id": "fe852104-1585-5de0-84c1-20bb5d34a53a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arturo Beltrán Leyva, Héctor Beltrán Leyva, Edgar Valdez Villarreal\n- Organizations: Beltrán Leyva Cartel, La Barredora\n- Roles: cartel boss, faction leader, right-hand man, suspected drug lord\n\nFacts:\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal was born on August 11, 1973.\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal is also known as La Barbie.\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal is a Mexican American suspected drug lord and a leader of the Beltrán Leyva Cartel, a criminal group based in Sinaloa.\n- Arturo Beltrán Leyva was the top boss of the cartel until the Mexican military killed him in December 2009.\n- After Arturo Beltrán Leyva died in December 2009, Héctor Beltrán Leyva took control of one faction of the cartel.\n- After Arturo Beltrán Leyva died in December 2009, Héctor Beltrán Leyva declared war on Edgar Valdez Villarreal.\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal had long served as Arturo Beltrán Leyva’s right-hand man before Arturo Beltrán Leyva was killed.",
